Telepono ni Fei.

274
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:34,590
Kasal lang ito sa pangalan.

275
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,216
Wala kaming nararamdaman ni Chloe para sa isa't isa.

276
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,680
Magkaibigan lang kami.

277
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,400
Si Chloe?

278
